      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SKATE IN PARIS (1) was in the money two back in a Grade 6 at this track then jumped from a squeeze draw last time and was not far away when second (19.91) over 342m at Angle Park. Can turn form around here. JULIE KEEPING (2) took advantage of a low draw last start with an all-the-way win (23.04) at Dubbo in a Grade 5 over 400m. Can make it back-to-back wins. MOLLEY MACALLAN (5) is generally an honest type in the frame at six of 14 starts but missed the placings last time when fifth (17.20) over 300m at Murray Bridge. Looks suited and expected to run well. LARNI LOU (8) warrants respect although new to this track.",
